#: webdavplugin/webdavplugin.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The WebDAV service allows access to any Web application that uses the WebDAV "
"protocol, such as ownCloud, Kolab, and others."
msgstr ""
"El serviciu WebDAV permítete acceder a cualesquier aplicación web qu'use'l "
"protocolu WebDAV como: nextCloud, Kolab y otros."

